                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 560.0, 53.0, 276.0, 47.0 ],
                    "text": "an OSC message consists of a made up name(s) followed by the forward slash (e.g. /status, or /help, but also /source/number <int value>). "
