                    "maxclass": "comment",
                    "numinlets": 1,
                    "numoutlets": 0,
                    "patching_rect": [ 213.5, 252.0, 298.0, 100.0 ],
                    "text": "spat5.oper is a key component in the spat5 system.  \nIt addresses the low level controls in \nspat5.spat~ (reverb and spatial module)\nspat5.oper uses higher-level perception-based control \nfor parametric control of spat5.spat~\nIt has a built in spat-viewer as well.  \nDOUBLE-CLICK TO ENTER"
                }
